<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>TWZ</title><link>https://www.twz.com</link><description>防御世界的强大进攻。</description><lastBuildDate>Thu, 06 Aug 2026 02:30:22 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>在德国乌克兰 An-124 旁边发现的爆炸无人机预示着新的威胁现实</title><link>https://www.twz.com/news-features/explosive-drone-found-next-to-ukrainian-an-124-in-germany-signals-a-new-threat-reality</link><description>&lt;p&gt;目前还不清楚谁是这起事件的幕后黑手，但乌克兰的 An-124 可能是可以想象到的乌克兰境外的象征性和战略性目标。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/news-features/explosive-drone-found-next-to-ukrainian-an-124-in-germany-signals-a-new-threat-reality"&gt;在德国乌克兰 An-124 旁边发现的爆炸无人机预示着新的威胁现实&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 06 Aug 2026 00:12:56 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/news-features/explosive-drone-found-next-to-ukrainian-an-124-in-germany-signals-a-new-threat-reality</guid></item><item><title>朝鲜增加对俄罗斯的弹道导弹供应对乌克兰来说是个坏消息</title><link>https://www.twz.com/land/north-korea-upping-ballistic-missile-supplies-to-russia-would-be-bad-news-for-ukraine-at-the-worst-time</link><description>&lt;p&gt;基辅声称朝鲜正在向俄罗斯发射更多弹道导弹之际，乌克兰由于缺乏爱国者导弹而对此类袭击变得毫无防御能力。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/land/north-korea-upping-ballistic-missile-supplies-to-russia-would-be-bad-news-for-ukraine-at-the-worst-time"&gt;朝鲜在最糟糕的时刻增加对俄罗斯的弹道导弹供应对乌克兰来说是个坏消息，&lt;/a&gt;该文章首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 05 Aug 2026 21:31:56 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/land/north-korea-upping-ballistic-missile-supplies-to-russia-would-be-bad-news-for-ukraine-at-the-worst-time</guid></item><item><title>XQ-58 Valkyrie 在犹他州达格威试验场坠毁（更新）</title><link>https://www.twz.com/news-features/xq-58-valkyrie-drone-crashes-at-dugway-proving-ground-in-utah</link><description>&lt;p&gt;隐形自主无人机的制造商奎托斯表示，该无人机在“测试配置”下起飞时坠毁。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/news-features/xq-58-valkyrie-drone-crashes-at-dugway-proving-ground-in-utah"&gt;XQ-58 Valkyrie 在犹他州杜格威试验场坠毁后（已更新）&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 05 Aug 2026 21:28:58 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/news-features/xq-58-valkyrie-drone-crashes-at-dugway-proving-ground-in-utah</guid></item><item><title>胡塞武装将袭击范围扩大到红海北部</title><link>https://www.twz.com/news-features/houthis-to-expand-shipping-attacks-to-northern-red-sea</link><description>&lt;p&gt;如果胡塞武装开始袭击驶向苏伊士运河的船只，这可能对世界能源供应造成又一次灾难性打击。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/news-features/houthis-to-expand-shipping-attacks-to-northern-red-sea"&gt;胡塞武装扩大对红海北部航运攻击的&lt;/a&gt;帖子首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 05 Aug 2026 18:19:03 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/news-features/houthis-to-expand-shipping-attacks-to-northern-red-sea</guid></item><item><title>P-8 Poseidon 机组人员控制 MQ-4C Triton 无人机成为现实</title><link>https://www.twz.com/air/p-8-poseidon-crews-controlling-mq-4c-triton-drones-becoming-a-reality</link><description>&lt;p&gt;P-8A 和 MQ-4C 被设计为协同工作，但对 Triton 的直接飞行控制将开启新的战术可能性，并大大扩展 Poseidon 的攻击范围。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/air/p-8-poseidon-crews-controlling-mq-4c-triton-drones-becoming-a-reality"&gt;P-8 Poseidon 船员控制 MQ-4C Triton 无人机成为现实&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 05 Aug 2026 18:03:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/air/p-8-poseidon-crews-controlling-mq-4c-triton-drones-becoming-a-reality</guid></item><item><title>中国不断壮大的区域弹道导弹武库：指南</title><link>https://www.twz.com/land/chinas-growing-regional-ballistic-missile-arsenal-a-guide</link><description>&lt;p&gt;从威胁台湾的短程导弹到可以到达关岛的双功能武器，这些不同的系统是中国反介入战略的关键组成部分。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/land/chinas-growing-regional-ballistic-missile-arsenal-a-guide"&gt;《中国不断增长的区域弹道导弹武器库：指南》&lt;/a&gt;一文首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 05 Aug 2026 16:50:12 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/land/chinas-growing-regional-ballistic-missile-arsenal-a-guide</guid></item><item><title>特朗普下令重做白宫直升机停机坪建设：报告</title><link>https://www.twz.com/air/trump-orders-white-house-helipad-construction-redo-report</link><description>&lt;p&gt;该直升机停机坪最初预计将在中国国家主席习近平九月份抵达时完工。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/air/trump-orders-white-house-helipad-construction-redo-report"&gt;特朗普命令白宫直升机停机坪重做：报告&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 04 Aug 2026 22:53:33 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/air/trump-orders-white-house-helipad-construction-redo-report</guid></item><item><title>陆军重振巨型火炮以推进高超音速测试</title><link>https://www.twz.com/land/army-revives-giant-cannon-to-advance-hypersonic-testing</link><description>&lt;p&gt;陆军正在将其取消的远程超级火炮转变为一个测试平台，该平台可以加速高超音速的开发，同时减少对昂贵的飞行测试的依赖。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/land/army-revives-giant-cannon-to-advance-hypersonic-testing"&gt;陆军复兴巨型加农炮以推进高超音速测试后&lt;/a&gt;首先出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 04 Aug 2026 21:15:52 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/land/army-revives-giant-cannon-to-advance-hypersonic-testing</guid></item><item><title>伊朗和阿曼努力控制霍尔木兹海峡，不稳定的停火仍然有效</title><link>https://www.twz.com/news-features/iran-and-oman-working-to-control-strait-of-hormuz-shaky-ceasefire-still-holding</link><description>&lt;p&gt;特朗普表示，他已经给了达成协议的最后机会，美国和伊朗并没有互相攻击，而海峡仍然是最紧迫的症结所在。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/news-features/iran-and-oman-working-to-control-strait-of-hormuz-shaky-ceasefire-still-holding"&gt;伊朗和阿曼努力控制霍尔木兹海峡，摇摇欲坠的停火仍维持&lt;/a&gt;在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 04 Aug 2026 18:12:50 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/news-features/iran-and-oman-working-to-control-strait-of-hormuz-shaky-ceasefire-still-holding</guid></item><item><title>X-62A携带红外搜索和跟踪吊舱，利用人工智能“大脑”自主拦截“敌人”T-38</title><link>https://www.twz.com/air/x-62a-toting-infrared-search-and-track-pod-used-its-ai-brain-to-autonomously-intercept-an-enemy-t-38</link><description>&lt;p&gt;能够自主使用机载传感器数据来应对空中威胁正是美国空军对其未来 CCA 无人机的期望。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;a href="https://www.twz.com/air/x-62a-toting-infrared-search-and-track-pod-used-its-ai-brain-to-autonomously-intercept-an-enemy-t-38"&gt;携带红外搜索和跟踪吊舱的后 X-62A 使用其人工智能“大脑”自主拦截“敌人”T-38&lt;/a&gt;首次出现在&lt;a href="https://www.twz.com"&gt;TWZ&lt;/a&gt;上。&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 04 Aug 2026 17:48:15 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.twz.com/air/x-62a-toting-infrared-search-and-track-pod-used-its-ai-brain-to-autonomously-intercept-an-enemy-t-38</guid></item></channel></rss>